    "evidence": {
      "state_offset": "mainStateMgr and BaseState::ChangeState load/store gv+0x244; onStartApp stores the initial state there.",
      "offline_flag_offset": "StateMainMenu::KeyTitle reads gv+0x8d before entering its offline branch.",
      "sms_flag_offset": "CommonUi::LoadLocalSaveData loads the saved SMS response into gv+0x2a.",
      "state_fields": "StateMainMenu::SetState writes state/substate at +0xc/+0xd; constructor initializes popup at +0x14.",
      "viewport_fields": "MIDASKernelManager::init2DScreen reads +0x624/+0x628.",
      "vtable_bias": "StateMainMenu constructor stores resolved vtable+8.",
      "copy_framebuffer": "Target DWARF and instructions confirm dst/dx/dy/w/h/src/sx/sy/context/trans parameters; framebuffer width/height/stride/bits/pixels at +0/+4/+8/+12/+16; context clip at +4..+16, alpha at +32 and pixel operator at +44. Native opaque path falls back for blending, transparency, overlap and unsupported inputs.",
      "raster565": "Target instructions verify Graphic RGB type at +0x5c, clip rectangle at +0x40e0..+0x40ec; GbmImage type/width/height/palette/pixels at +0/+2/+4/+8/+12. Alpha fill preserves target /256 truncation; native indexed path accepts only fully-contained rectangles, palette 4/8-bit and verified mirror/anchor modes. SKIP_COLOR resolved through target symbol, with guest fallback otherwise.",
      "blend565": "Target frame/rectangle effects read the existing 1024-byte lookup for mode at Graphic+0x6d+mode*1024, preserving alpha>>3, green quantization and full-alpha threshold 248. MC_grpFillRect kernel getter is read-only; opaque native fill preserves signed-size normalization and context clipping, falling back for alpha/pixel operations.",
      "font_bridge": "Target BFont symbols fingerprinted; native width/line instructions differential-tested across offsets, styles, colors and Hangul. Display scratch replaces only font-call arguments, leaving source/save text unchanged.",
      "palette565": "Target ChangeBlendingPal RGB565 branch and GbmImage backup/marker getters verified: backup +16, changed +20, byte count +1. 384 ARM differential cases preserve palette/marker/return values, skip color, flags and quantization.",
      "saved_quest_render": "Target QuestMgr::DrawQuestString passes saved description this+28 to BFont::DrawTextLine at 0xce3e8. BFont reads text at argument6 and width at argument4 before measuring/slicing. Exact-text display substitution occurs before slicing, preserving QuestMgr and save bytes."
